         text="Taira no Shigehira, sent to punish the Nara monks for siding with the Minamoto, sets fires that a night wind spreads through Kōfuku-ji and Tōdai-ji. The Great Buddha's head melts; the Heike monogatari says 1,700 people who had fled to the hall's upper storey died.",
